"""Single source for the desk rulebook: docs/rules/<id>.md and the public.desk_rules seed.
Numbers come from tools/court (sim.py, grid*.py, replay.py) on the 2026-09-26 ledger.
MC = Monte Carlo, one year at ledger pace (QUANTANAMO 100, ODDSBORNE 150, BANDIT 400 trades),
returns bootstrapped from each steward's real trade_outcomes, re-centred to a true Sharpe/trade.
P(DD50) = chance of a >= 50% peak-to-trough drawdown within the year; ruin = book < 20% of start."""

